!--- Model Parameters (as in solver) --far_field_ratio_doublet = 10.0 far_field_ratio_source = 10.0 doublet_threshold = 1.0e-6 rankine_rad = 0.1 vortex_rad = 0.1 cutoff_rad = 0.001
